## SQ-TPF-14 | MC-72151 a snow golem's snowball does not hurt a wolf (fixed: 8.0 health) or takes 0.5 (bug: 7.5)
> summon minecraft:snow_golem 1500 -60 1014 {NoAI:1b,UUID:[I;72151,1,2,3]}
> summon minecraft:wolf 1500 -60 1010 {Health:8f,NoAI:1b,Tags:["w72151"]}
sleep 1
> summon minecraft:snowball 1500 -57 1010 {Motion:[0.0d,-1.0d,0.0d],Owner:[I;72151,1,2,3]}
sleep 3
> data get entity @e[tag=w72151,limit=1] Health
