## SQ-TPF-18 | MC-2025 25 cows in a fenced pen through 12 chunk unload and reload cycles: none outside (fixed)
> forceload add 1990 1990 2010 2010
sleep 4
# 25 cows in 25 blocks die of cramming (maxEntityCramming 24) after a reload: the r1114 losses were deaths (beef and
# leather by the pen), not escapes. Off for this row only.
> gamerule maxEntityCramming 0
> kill @e[tag=p2025]
> fill 1995 -60 1995 2001 -60 2001 minecraft:oak_fence
> fill 1996 -60 1996 2000 -60 2000 minecraft:air
pace 0
repeat 25
> summon minecraft:cow 1998 -60 1998 {Tags:["p2025"],PersistenceRequired:1b}
end
pace 2
sleep 10
> data get entity @e[tag=p2025,limit=1] AABB
repeat 12
> forceload remove 1990 1990 2010 2010
sleep 12
> execute if entity @e[tag=p2025]
> forceload add 1990 1990 2010 2010
sleep 10
> execute if entity @e[tag=p2025,x=1996,y=-61,z=1996,dx=4,dy=3,dz=4]
> execute as @e[tag=p2025] unless entity @s[x=1996,y=-61,z=1996,dx=4,dy=3,dz=4] run say p2025-out
end
> execute if entity @e[tag=p2025]
> gamerule maxEntityCramming 24
look no "p2025-out" line in fix (an escape = MC-2025); base: any "p2025-out" = bug reproduced; a total below 25 with no "out" line is a death (r1114: cramming, suffocation), not the bug; the 12 "unloaded" checks print Test failed
expect has the following entity data
